      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm? I’m doing some repair work here, kid.\nI mean, I’m on break now, but still.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you wanna use the Holovator?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200079006F0075002000770061006E006E00610020007500730065002000740068006500200048006F006C006F007600610074006F0072003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry, I’m still working on it! Besides, I’m on my\nbreak right now.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F007200720079002C002000492019006D0020007300740069006C006C00200077006F0072006B0069006E00670020006F006E002000690074002100200042006500730069006400650073002C002000492019006D0020006F006E0020006D0079000A0062007200650061006B0020007200690067006800740020006E006F0077002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I know! Why don’t you and I have a Pokémon\nbattle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000490020006B006E006F00770021002000570068007900200064006F006E2019007400200079006F007500200061006E006400200049002000680061007600650020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0062006100740074006C0065003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If I can have a battle, that’ll be enough of a break\nfor me. I’ll get right back to work afterward!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just give me a heads-up if you want to battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A007500730074002000670069007600650020006D006500200061002000680065006100640073002D0075007000200069006600200079006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F00200062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I promise I’ll get the Holovator up and running in\nno time if you’ll have a battle with me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll win in no time!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000770069006E00200069006E0020006E006F002000740069006D006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll pass, I think",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200070006100730073002C002000490020007400680069006E006B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shame. Guess I’ll just have to take a nice, long\nbreak to unwind.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300680061006D0065002E002000470075006500730073002000492019006C006C0020006A0075007300740020006800610076006500200074006F002000740061006B0065002000610020006E006900630065002C0020006C006F006E0067000A0062007200650061006B00200074006F00200075006E00770069006E0064002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Great, I was in the mood for a battle! Let’s get\ngoing!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006500610074002C00200049002000770061007300200069006E00200074006800650020006D006F006F006400200066006F00720020006100200062006100740074006C006500210020004C00650074201900730020006700650074000A0067006F0069006E0067002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, come on—no one can expect me to fix that\nHolovator if it’s stuck in a battle zone!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was a fun battle! Guess it’s time for me to\nwrap up my break.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074002000770061007300200061002000660075006E00200062006100740074006C0065002100200047007500650073007300200069007420190073002000740069006D006500200066006F00720020006D006500200074006F000A00770072006100700020007500700020006D007900200062007200650061006B002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now then, let me get the Holovator all fixed up.\nIt won’t take a minute!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aaand I’m done! The Holovator’s up and running.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100610061006E0064002000492019006D00200064006F006E00650021002000540068006500200048006F006C006F007600610074006F00722019007300200075007000200061006E0064002000720075006E006E0069006E0067002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know the Pokémon I used in our battle?\nI caught them all up on the rooftops!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I ran into ’em all while I was on the job too!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI got so focused on catching them, I almost\nmissed break time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My point is, you can find all sorts of Pokémon on\nthe rooftops around the city. You should have a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlook around next time you’re up there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And see, I told you I could have this thing fixed in\nno time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020007300650065002C0020004900200074006F006C006400200079006F00750020004900200063006F0075006C006400200068006100760065002000740068006900730020007400680069006E006700200066006900780065006400200069006E000A006E006F002000740069006D0065002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You can find all sorts of Pokémon up on the\nrooftops. You should look around!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
